					<description><![CDATA[Craving a quick getaway but don’t want to spend a fortune? You’re in luck! It’s still possible to plan a European weekend trip, including flights and accommodation, for under €150. Whether you’re after culture, food, or a scenic stroll by the sea, these destinations prove that adventure doesn’t have to come with a high price tag.]]></description>
		
		
		
